1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,495
Assalamu Alaikum, and welcome.

2
00:00:02,545 --> 00:00:06,087
I'm Muhammad Farooq, the founder of Goodhand.

3
00:00:06,137 --> 00:00:10,637
In the next few minutes, I'll show you how Goodhand makes

4
00:00:10,687 --> 00:00:14,947
finding, booking and paying for local services simple,

5
00:00:14,997 --> 00:00:19,816
safe and fair, for customers and for service providers alike.

6
00:00:20,516 --> 00:00:22,863
Today, most of us find a tutor,

7
00:00:22,913 --> 00:00:28,663
an electrician or a photographer through WhatsApp groups and word of mouth.

8
00:00:28,713 --> 00:00:33,070
There are no real reviews, no easy way to compare prices,

9
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:36,395
payments happen in cash with no protection,

10
00:00:36,445 --> 00:00:40,029
and providers juggle bookings in paper diaries.

11
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:42,117
Goodhand fixes all of that.

12
00:00:42,817 --> 00:00:44,148
This is Goodhand.

13
00:00:44,198 --> 00:00:48,777
Every provider you see here has been checked by our team,

14
00:00:48,827 --> 00:00:51,295
and every payment is protected.

15
00:00:51,345 --> 00:00:54,300
You can search for anything you need,

16
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:57,549
or start from a category, like tutoring,

17
00:00:57,599 --> 00:01:01,204
home repair, photography, events or cleaning.

18
00:01:01,904 --> 00:01:05,276
Search results are ranked by our trust score,

19
00:01:05,326 --> 00:01:06,949
not just star ratings.

20
00:01:06,999 --> 00:01:09,914
It rewards providers who reply quickly,

21
00:01:09,964 --> 00:01:14,173
finish what they accept, and keep their customers happy.

22
00:01:14,223 --> 00:01:16,606
You can filter by price, rating,

23
00:01:16,656 --> 00:01:19,800
distance, and the exact day you need help,

24
00:01:19,850 --> 00:01:23,070
and save your favourites with a single tap.

25
00:01:23,770 --> 00:01:26,543
Every service page shows real photos,

26
00:01:26,593 --> 00:01:33,027
the price, the duration, and reviews from customers who actually completed a booking.

27
00:01:33,077 --> 00:01:36,766
Pick a date, and you only see the time slots that

28
00:01:36,816 --> 00:01:38,215
are genuinely free.

29
00:01:38,265 --> 00:01:40,047
No more double bookings.

30
00:01:40,747 --> 00:01:45,256
At checkout, you tell the provider where to come and what

31
00:01:45,306 --> 00:01:46,615
the job involves.

32
00:01:46,665 --> 00:01:49,415
Then comes the most important part.

33
00:01:49,465 --> 00:01:52,454
Your payment is held safely in escrow.

34
00:01:52,504 --> 00:01:56,374
The provider is paid only after the work is done,

35
00:01:56,424 --> 00:01:59,173
and if they decline, or you cancel,

36
00:01:59,223 --> 00:02:00,933
you get a full refund.

37
00:02:01,633 --> 00:02:05,229
After booking, everything lives in one place.

38
00:02:05,279 --> 00:02:08,147
The status of your job, the address,

39
00:02:08,197 --> 00:02:11,226
and a private chat with your provider.

40
00:02:11,276 --> 00:02:16,413
You get notifications, plus reminders a day before and two hours

41
00:02:16,463 --> 00:02:18,520
before, so nobody forgets.

42
00:02:19,220 --> 00:02:24,508
Your dashboard keeps your bookings, messages and saved providers together.

43
00:02:24,558 --> 00:02:27,538
When the job is done, you accept the work,

44
00:02:27,588 --> 00:02:31,722
and leave an honest review that helps the whole community.

45
00:02:32,422 --> 00:02:34,988
Now let me show you the other side.

46
00:02:35,038 --> 00:02:37,230
If you are a service provider,

47
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:39,771
Goodhand is your business toolkit.

48
00:02:39,821 --> 00:02:44,106
Your dashboard shows how many people viewed your services,

49
00:02:44,156 --> 00:02:48,814
your acceptance and completion rates, your earnings this month,

50
00:02:48,864 --> 00:02:50,383
and your trust score.

51
00:02:51,083 --> 00:02:57,130
New requests arrive already paid, so you never waste time on fake bookings.

52
00:02:57,180 --> 00:03:03,470
Accept with one click, and the slot is blocked on your calendar automatically.

53
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,852
Going on holiday?

54
00:03:04,902 --> 00:03:09,160
Just block those days, and customers can't book them.

55
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:14,238
Your earnings page shows exactly where every rupee is.

56
00:03:14,288 --> 00:03:17,928
Held in escrow, awaiting payout, or paid out,

57
00:03:17,978 --> 00:03:20,305
with a transaction reference.

58
00:03:20,355 --> 00:03:24,405
Add your bank account, JazzCash or Easypaisa once,

59
00:03:24,455 --> 00:03:26,783
and we send your money there.

60
00:03:27,483 --> 00:03:32,522
To join, providers add their business details and upload their CNIC.

61
00:03:32,572 --> 00:03:37,313
This verification is what lets customers trust you from day one,

62
00:03:37,363 --> 00:03:41,055
and it keeps fake accounts out of the marketplace.

63
00:03:41,755 --> 00:03:46,100
Behind the scenes, our admin team reviews every application.

64
00:03:46,150 --> 00:03:49,249
They can see all the details and documents,

65
00:03:49,299 --> 00:03:54,011
and either approve the provider, or ask for specific corrections,

66
00:03:54,061 --> 00:03:57,600
which are sent straight to the provider by email.

67
00:03:58,300 --> 00:04:02,674
If something ever goes wrong, either side can raise a dispute.

68
00:04:02,724 --> 00:04:06,241
The admin sees the full chat history and timeline,

69
00:04:06,291 --> 00:04:10,951
and decides fairly whether to release the payment to the provider,

70
00:04:11,001 --> 00:04:12,592
or refund the customer.

71
00:04:13,292 --> 00:04:16,696
Admins also manage payouts, moderate listings,

72
00:04:16,746 --> 00:04:21,201
and watch a security dashboard that flags suspicious logins.

73
00:04:21,251 --> 00:04:25,181
Every important action is recorded in an audit trail,

74
00:04:25,231 --> 00:04:27,734
so the platform stays accountable.

75
00:04:28,434 --> 00:04:31,640
And Goodhand works beautifully on any device,

76
00:04:31,690 --> 00:04:35,909
in light or dark mode, because most of our customers browse

77
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:37,067
on their phones.

78
00:04:37,767 --> 00:04:39,828
So, why move to Goodhand?

79
00:04:39,878 --> 00:04:44,050
For customers: verified providers, honest reviews,

80
00:04:44,100 --> 00:04:48,610
and payments that are protected until the job is done.

81
00:04:48,660 --> 00:04:55,028
For providers: real, paid bookings, a calendar that prevents double booking,

82
00:04:55,078 --> 00:04:59,588
and a reputation that grows with every happy customer.

83
00:05:00,288 --> 00:05:01,900
Join Goodhand today.

84
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:06,387
Create a free account, as a customer or as a provider,

85
00:05:06,437 --> 00:05:10,375
and experience the safer way to get things done.

86
00:05:10,425 --> 00:05:12,286
Thank you for watching.

87
00:05:12,336 --> 00:05:16,440
I'm Muhammad Farooq, and I'll see you on Goodhand.
